# The spectator camera (view.c): the prologue's far-off view, as if watching at the arcades.
# The game boots into the opening flight, which lands here (hurried along: see below). The
# cycle should be a few pixels across in the middle, with no walls and no HUD, the floor fading
# into the dark. No bot: in the loop the CPU is alone. The camera keeps its diagonal angle.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
start_intro # the opening flight, from wherever the game boots (run.sh)
# Hurry it (any button but START or Z, once: x3), so it lands in about 3 s
press b
wait 3.5
wait 0.5
shot spectate_1
wait 2.5
shot spectate_2
wait 2.5
shot spectate_3
